sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant NX as Nginx
    participant OS as Order Service
    participant PGO as PostgreSQL (order_service)
    Client->>NX: POST /api/orders (Idempotency-Key k)
    alt over ORDER_RATE
        NX-->>Client: 429 Too Many Requests (Order Service never sees it)
    else within the rate limit
        NX->>OS: POST /api/orders (Idempotency-Key k)
        OS->>PGO: look up k: not found
        Note over OS,PGO: a known key is answered 200 before any admission check
        Note over OS: admission: Outbox backlog, unfinished orders, concurrency slot
        OS-->>Client: 503 Service Unavailable, Retry-After: 1 (a limit is reached)
        Note over OS,PGO: nothing written: no order, no Outbox row
    end
    Note over Client: wait, then retry with the SAME Idempotency-Key
    Client->>NX: POST /api/orders (Idempotency-Key k)
    NX->>OS: POST /api/orders (Idempotency-Key k)
    OS->>PGO: one transaction: order (PendingStock) + Outbox row OrderPlaced
    OS-->>Client: 201 Created (or 200 with the original order if k was accepted before)
